# Base URL of the TechDeva FastAPI platform that serves POST /signup.
# Leave empty to build a site whose trial form validates but refuses to submit
# (it says so on screen) — the safe default for local work, so nobody creates
# real tenants from a laptop by accident.
# Production example: VITE_API_BASE=https://portal.techdeva.net
# The API's ALLOWED_ORIGINS must include the site origin for this to work.
VITE_API_BASE=
